<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on the Nikkei 225.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on the Nikkei 225.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG</p>
<p>says it has issued three million American-style call warrants,</p>
<p>on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    **			  PREMIUM	16.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.70 CHF		  GEARING	5.95 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 24.APR.97-23.JUL.98   PAYDATE	20.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> NOTES	    **THE LOWEST OFFICIAL NIKKEI 225 CLOSING PRICE</p>
<p>		    DURING THE LOOKBACK PERIOD(23.JAN.97-23.APR.97)</p>
<p>		    BUT NOT HIGHER THAN ON THE DAY OF ISSUANCE</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
